    "detailed_description": "You have to climb to the top using hooks. <br />\r\nUse the keyboard to move, and the mouse to control your hands and hooks (or gamepad if you are not in enough pain). <br />\r\nOnly the most persistent will make it to the top.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Prepare to fall down.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Practice and over time you will be able to overcome those obstacles that at first seemed impassable.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Don't give up, because only the persistent can overcome difficulties.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Legs... You can use your legs, but they're not much help.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNote from developer:<br />\r\nThis game was also made by one person, me(hello). This game is inspired by &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy&quot; and &quot;A Difficult Game About Climbing&quot;. The game was first person at first, but it didn't feel unique. After playing &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy&quot; and &quot;A Difficult Game About Climbing&quot; I thought this style of game would be better, and I wasn't wrong. So I too want to, and hopefully contribute to the &quot;Foddian Type&quot; genre.",
    "about_the_game": "You have to climb to the top using hooks. <br />\r\nUse the keyboard to move, and the mouse to control your hands and hooks (or gamepad if you are not in enough pain). <br />\r\nOnly the most persistent will make it to the top.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Prepare to fall down.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Practice and over time you will be able to overcome those obstacles that at first seemed impassable.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Don't give up, because only the persistent can overcome difficulties.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Legs... You can use your legs, but they're not much help.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNote from developer:<br />\r\nThis game was also made by one person, me(hello). This game is inspired by &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy&quot; and &quot;A Difficult Game About Climbing&quot;. The game was first person at first, but it didn't feel unique. After playing &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy&quot; and &quot;A Difficult Game About Climbing&quot; I thought this style of game would be better, and I wasn't wrong. So I too want to, and hopefully contribute to the &quot;Foddian Type&quot; genre.",
    "short_description": "It's a difficult game about a man with hooks.",
